# source: High-school curriculum inventory, algebra direction.
# problem: Evaluate a mean and a logarithm using the Chapter 2 and Chapter 3 interfaces.
# proof_idea: Substitute the supplied values into the public formulas and simplify.
# litex_code: The two exercises below are the runnable reformulations.
